  "description": "<p><span style=\"color: #2b00ff;\"><strong>Now also available in WHITE</strong></span></p>\n<p>Siglon PEx8 offers one of the best values in the eight strand braid market. It is Japanese made eight strand PE featuring great lineal and knot strength with a tight weave and high abrasion resistance with low diameter size. The PE fiber provides high sensitivity and low color bleed.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Spool Length | Color | LB Test</strong></p>\n<p>165 YD | Dark Green | 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>165 YD | Hi-Vis Orange |<span style=\"color: rgb(43, 0, 255);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 128, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(43, 0, 255);\">5, 6, 8,</span> </span>10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50</span></p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">1980 YD | Dark Green | 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 80, 90, 100<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">1980 YD | Hi-Vis Orange | 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50<meta charset=\"utf-8\">, 60, 80, 90, 100<br></span><span style=\"color: #2b00ff;\">1980 YD | White | 30, 40, 50<meta charset=\"utf-8\">, 60, 80, 90, 100</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Standard Dia. (inch / mm)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0532/9777/4771/files/Dia_Siglon_PE8.jpg?v=1744574064\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0532/9777/4771/files/warning_71f1a8fd-822f-4db4-a792-773b6cf9fd83_480x480.jpg?v=1615500049\" alt=\"\"><br><strong>CALIFORNIA PROPOSITION 65<br>WARNING: </strong>These products can expose you to chemicals including lead or DINP, which is known to the state of California to cause cancer and birth defects or other reproductive harm. For more information go to <a href=\"http://www.p65warnings.ca.gov/\" target=\"_blank\">P65Warnings.ca.gov</a></span></p>",
